ow** to **Off** or **Shadows Only** on a mesh in the Advanced Import Settings dialog.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test_pr_106762.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20460518/test_pr_106762.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106874/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106874/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}